le defines them, as B6 defined the two de\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:715:Unchanged from B6 section 5.1 in substance. The identity H is\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:746:Unchanged from B6 section 5.2 in substance. Validation includes the\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:756:B6 section 7 paired H and R by mint-time datoms and verified the pair by\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:761:B6 names and shapes and read the derivation from the manifest; the\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:875:;; by bare identity: B6's closed-image path, no manifest\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:926:The B6 signature changes in its first argument:\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:1695:    in the outcome, exactly as B6's trusted fallback did and never\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:1698:  The B6 fallback pair maps onto these: `verifying-fallback` is the\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:1709:  addresses, the H and R indexes of B6 section 6 carried beside the\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:1967:`yin.vm.debruijn.linker.md` was first marked superseded by this\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:1968:document in its status line (2026-09-25); when the completion audit\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:1972:(2026-10-01). No behavior changes. The B6 test suite passes unchanged\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:1982:move to `fetch` with the new records. Tests, beyond B6's matrix for the\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:2000:buffers on all three hosts; the JVM WebSocket path from B6 completion\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:2171:5. Every B6 completion criterion -- the refusal matrix, the structure\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.dht.md:3:Status: **contract frozen 2026-10-01 (linker-over-DHT epic slice L-design,\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.dht.md:43:2026-10-01\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.dht.md:62:  (2026-10-01). Every operation here is a plain Clojure function;\n./docs/orchestrator-log.md:6593:- Completed standalone B6 Linker design (docs/design/yin.vm.debruijn.linker.md):\n./docs/orchestrator-log.md:7144:  yin.vm.debruijn.linker.md status line marks it superseded. Gate\n./docs/orchestrator-log.md:7151:  DELETING yin.vm.debruijn.linker.md (with content merge into\n./docs/design/yin.vm.debruijn.stack.md:719:B6 was specified in `docs/design/yin.vm.debruijn.linker.md`, the\n./docs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:5:predecessor `yin.vm.debruijn.linker.md`; that document's fetch\n./docs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:1967:`yin.vm.debruijn.linker.md` was first marked superseded by this\n./docs/design/dao.stream.remote.implementation-plan.md:165:- `yin.vm.debruijn.linker.md`, `dao.space.query.md`,\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
